> 
> 3) On the castle level, the wand of wishing only had one charge (lucky
> for me that I had the Platinum Yendorian Express Card from my starting
> WoW) what can you do if this happens in a normal game?
> 
You wish for blessed scrolls of charging with the first wish.

> 4) What objects will I need (i.e. can't possibly do without) to 
> complete the game?
> 
Amulet of Yendor. Period. To get the amulet you need bell, book, candelabrum
and candles. You also absolutely need some means of crossing water (levitation
is best here). Plus, of course, you can't survive without food. All the rest 
is more-or-less optional ;-)

> 5) Is there any way of getting beyond level 30?
> 
Sure, and in 3.1.1 it is straightforward (trapdoor in the castle, then 
just stairs down).

